msgctxt "badend2:badend2_33A5723D_E91F_4B4B_B3E7_29178B387314"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If what she said was true, ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫he⟪k:3⟫ could not give up on ⟪k:4⟫Your⟪k:5⟫his⟪k:6⟫ "
"search."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se o que ela disse for verdade, ⟪k:1⟫Você⟪k:2⟫ele⟪k:3⟫ não pode desistir de ⟪k:4⟫Sua⟪k:5⟫"
"sua⟪k:6⟫ busca."

#: badend2:badend2_80517542_50EF_4845_B1BE_3B78A8E57242
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9efadec21441532108be0a3aa4c10b44a9dc1b9636eb0439dbb4c55f47bff699
