#: badend2:badend2_FC3E3AEE_F43B_4252_95DB_D3633CE93C81
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e7bdf5ee223b5b34821f5351449c0db469d6d0e29cb460e4a169f155a3baf656
