msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You⟪k:4⟫He⟪k:5⟫ brushed the Maid’s hand aside.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫As her eyes widened, "
"aghast, ⟪k:8⟫You⟪k:9⟫he⟪k:10⟫ fled from the observation tower."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Você⟪k:4⟫Ele⟪k:5⟫ afastou a mão da Criada.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Enquanto os olhos dela se "
"arregalavam, horrorizados, ⟪k:8⟫Você⟪k:9⟫ele⟪k:10⟫ fugiu da torre de observação."

#: badend2:badend2_A3A19873_9FF8_4F6D_ABA1_EB8E9A7EEE89
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 802fabe39314a7c317eee98e898d3cd58e164051d289424790c3b40e95361bfe
