msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫At long last, ⟪k:3⟫You⟪k:4⟫the Departed⟪k:5⟫ arrived at the bottom, dashing from "
"the next room without a passing glance at the angel in the stained-glass window."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Depois de muito tempo, ⟪k:3⟫Você⟪k:4⟫o Falecido⟪k:5⟫ chegou ao fim, passando pelo "
"próximo aposento sem olhar de relance para o anjo no vitral."

#: badend2:badend2_9452EA81_98F8_424E_9759_125A43BC5142
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e31eadb5c9b9c9024edea1dc2fbeeeded5fa993485f3867c6bc60b6a6966ffc8
