"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫The Maid had shown ⟪k:9⟫You⟪k:10⟫him⟪k:11⟫ around "
"the mansion, so ⟪k:12⟫You⟪k:13⟫he⟪k:14⟫ knew its layout."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫A Criada tinha mostrado para ⟪k:9⟫Você⟪k:10⟫"
"ele⟪k:11⟫ a mansão, então ⟪k:12⟫Você⟪k:13⟫ele⟪k:14⟫ conhecia seu layout."

