#: badend2:badend2_3A6FE51F_0E31_4710_817A_7E3EDCC8F603
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31e8f206371cbe6ff5e2c48863e065c734abe61dd71e3747a01883691838a0b4
