msgctxt "badend2:badend2_3A6FE51F_0E31_4710_817A_7E3EDCC8F603"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But the next moment, her voice seized ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫ from behind.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"You⟪k:7⟫The Departed⟪k:8⟫ turned back, and there stood the Maid,⟪k:9⟫wearing the same smile."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas no momento seguinte, a voz dela atingiu ⟪k:1⟫Você⟪k:2⟫ele⟪k:3⟫ pelas costas.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫Você⟪k:7⟫O Falecido⟪k:8⟫ se virou e lá estava a Criada,⟪k:9⟫carregando o mesmo sorriso."

#: badend2:badend2_0D38A2CE_82CE_43BC_B3C8_0FC474C863BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2375979a9f425fab21aa1f51183c7edd82f7ac2a81ae339db666841d4e8de9af
