msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Where do you think you are going, Master?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I told you, you mustn’t let go "
"of my hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Aonde você pensa que vai, Mestre?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Eu te disse, você não deve soltar minha "
"mão."

#: badend2:badend2_38309D2C_2E9B_4AC0_A323_3B24BC06066F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f5477ba780c06ceff16c7a2aed03913acf882c90f2051d83030335b40df08a88
